{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1380.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"661bc45296ade7f42cae20bed52e9d6302b520578ce4e94c7b858cbb6d539c8c","ja":"『太陽』をテーマに、それぞれが\n自分に合ったコーディネートを考えるという企画で……","zh":"这是一项以“太阳”为主题，\n让大家各自构想适合自己的穿搭的企划……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1380.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"7da43e9a10137b81875d03b5345390cacd72f65f33c3aa7def973a8baa4c1bcb","ja":"ねえ、みんなもう、\nどんなコーディネートにするか決めた？","zh":"呐，大家已经\n决定好要搭配什么服装了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1380.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"7b17bc84b06f2eca9b40ebbfd3a3c8645dc03c1f672c2e62f26c7714b26142c8","ja":"うん、バッチグーだよ、律っちゃん！","zh":"嗯，完美搞定哦，律子！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1380.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"71a5f3d5b8e63488d0e59e5ba9282181848bd17a18d0f6c446fef70bba556370","ja":"『太陽』がテーマなんだから、\nギラギラしたコーデにするっきゃないっしょ♪","zh":"既然主题是“太阳”，\n那当然得穿得耀眼闪亮才行啦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1380.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"20a0f10ee2c9a8d5053d560946c8b0546811e06470bcbed6b4898fec1f222784","ja":"ミキも、すっごく明るい感じにするつもりだよ。\nそうじゃないと、太陽っぽくならないって思うな。","zh":"美希也打算弄得超级开朗呢。\n美希觉得要是不那样的话，就显得不像太阳了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1380.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"504fd0172bffa3ecabfc30a1d9fa575fb14b5e0f4af610fd7e1268f022550df7","ja":"私は、ぽかぽか～って暖かい感じに\nしたいな～って。","zh":"我希望能办成这种暖洋洋的、\n让人感到温暖的感觉呢～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1380.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"aa9201f52772f3afa8146d5f0b6573c2e5bfd05736d4a0bf69e5298e33d89664","ja":"なるほど。みんなちゃんと考えてるのね……。","zh":"原来如此。大家都有在好好考虑呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1380.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"c1fe162725937a86fb1b25d3c9936b41e35957f91e39fcedd88f68e03db4f895","ja":"もしかして、律っちゃんはまだなの？","zh":"难不成，小律还没好吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1380.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"92e84a3bd9c0cd36efcda661e8b0c3ee2770d58dffcbe76213443bbaeb0230dd","ja":"ええ。『太陽』ってテーマで、\n私にどんなコーデが似合うのか、悩んじゃって……。","zh":"是的。以“太阳”为主题的话，\n我正纠结什么样的穿搭适合我呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1380.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"d19e8b378a8ae1c34865c8243e777eeb63907de69640bbe6ffe48cb9ca98529c","ja":"それなら、私たちで、\n律子さんに似合うコーデを考えましょうか？","zh":"既然这样，要不要由我们\n来为律子小姐构思适合她的穿搭呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1380.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"c61ab93fcaa4d2ec83a0c2a8c6f964ab205781b605f2d379b447ca03cbd63f10","ja":"わ～、なんかめっちゃ楽しそう♪\n亜美もやるやる～っ！","zh":"哇～感觉超好玩的♪\n亚美也要玩要玩～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1380.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"cf95d96dba92660bea0219ab9551532ccb18f91bc2dc32a9db9311062f5c2432","ja":"な、なんだか亜美にそんなに張り切られると\n不安を感じるけど……。","zh":"总、总觉得被亚美这么干劲十足地对待，\n反而有点让人不安呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1380.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"fbaeb6fb59820b3ee1375e4f63e8f40572412d1f91dea2a5d17c729795de2873","ja":"でもそうね……締め切りも近いし、\nぜひお願いするわ。","zh":"不过也是呢……截止日期也快到了，\n那就拜托你了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
